{"timestamp": "2025-07-19T18:39:06.488693", "function_name": "craft", "function_body": "  # Get the primitives needed for the recipe\n  needed_primitives = env.world.cookbook.primitives_for(item)\n\n  # Initialize a list to keep track of the items that have been crafted\n  crafted_items = []\n\n  # Loop through the needed primitives and craft them\n  for primitive, count in needed_primitives.items():\n    for _ in range(count):\n      # Craft the primitive using the appropriate recipe\n      recipe = env.world.cookbook.recipes[primitive]\n      for ingredient, ingredient_count in recipe.items():\n        if ingredient in env.world.workshop_indices:\n          # Craft the item at the appropriate workshop\n          env.step(env.action_specs()[\"USE\"])\n          crafted_items.append(ingredient)\n        else:\n          # Collect the ingredient from the environment\n          env.step(env.action_specs()[\"COLLECT_FUNC LPAR\" + ingredient + \"RPAR\"])\n      # Craft the primitive at the appropriate workshop\n      env.step(env.action_specs()[\"USE\"])\n      crafted_items.append(primitive)\n\n  # Craft the final item using the crafted primitives\n  for primitive in crafted_items:\n    env.step(env.action_specs()[\"USE\"])\n\n  return env._get_reward()", "island_id": 1, "scores": {"3": -1}}
